<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<mdscript name="FDN_Overview" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="md.xsd">
  <!--
    Card X4-15a. Read-only "FDN Overview" page on the game's Extension Options menu, using SirNuke's
    Mod Support APIs (Simple Menu API, Register_Options_Menu). OPTIONAL: without that extension nothing here runs.

    - Registered again every time md.Simple_Menu_API.Reloaded is signalled (every game load / UI reload), as the API asks.
    - On_Open builds the rows each time the page opens, from md.FDN_Core.Init (read only, writes nothing to the save):
        a Refresh button row, then for each Freight Distribution Centre (station with an FDN charter that is still
        player owned): a heading row (name, sector), a column title row, one row per ware in stock (stock and the
        game storage target), and a totals row (supplies, returns, units moved, fees paid, from Init.$DCStats,
        see DC_Stat_Add in md/fdn_core.xml).
    - With no DC there is one row saying so. The API allows at most 160 rows, so the page stops adding DC and ware
      rows at 150 and shows a "more not shown" row instead.
    - The page does not update by itself; Refresh (Simple Menu API Refresh_Menu) clears it and calls On_Open again.
    - A debug line (log level 4) is written each time the page is built: on opening, on every Refresh and when the
      game rebuilds the page (for example coming back from another options page). Card X4-15b checked the 15a log:
      the six lines at one time were six real builds (open, Refresh clicks, returns from the settings page) while the
      game was paused, so game time did not move. Not a fault, nothing to fix.
    - Card X4-15b: the heading shows the sector only when the station name does not already contain it.
    - Card X4-15c (display only): 4 columns. A summary row under Refresh (DCs online and totals summed over all DCs).
      DCs sorted by name, wares within a DC sorted by stock as a whole percent of the storage target, emptiest
      first (no target sorts last and shows '-'). New '% of target' column. The Stock cell is coloured by that
      percent: under 25 Color.text_negative (red), 25 to 75 Color.text_warning (orange/amber), above 75 the normal
      colour. Colour names are Color mapping ids from libraries/colors.xml; the Simple Menu API replaces any arg
      string starting with 'Color.' with the game Color table entry (ui/simple_menu/library.lua Replace_Color_Args).
      Sorting uses sort_list sortbyvalue, as the game scripts do (scenario_transport_refugees.xml, build.buildstorage.xml).
    - Card X4-15e (display only): a 'Needs attention' section after the summary row, from Init.$Attention (latest skip
      per station, see Attention_Set in md/fdn_core.xml), newest first, at most 15 rows plus a 'more' row, station in
      Color.text_warning. With no DC it is one line instead. A 'Recent activity' section at the end, from Init.$Activity
      (last 10 supplies, pulls, NPC buys and returns, newest first). Ages are whole game minutes,
      ((player.age - time) / 60s)i as vanilla cpu_ship_manager.xml. The DC tables stop 12 rows earlier so the
      activity rows always fit under the 160-row limit.
    - Card X4-15f (display only): each Recent activity entry is two rows. Row 1: 'N min ago, kind' | 'qty ware'
      (spans columns 2 and 3) | 'fee X Cr'. Row 2: one full-width line (4-column span, as the headings) 'from X to Y',
      so long station names are not cut off in a narrow column. Up to 20 activity rows, so the DC tables now stop
      at $Max - 20 (130). Worst case about 154 rows, under the 160-row limit.
    - Card X4-16a (display only, nothing saved): one 'Network:' row under each DC heading, listing the other DCs on this
      page within the DCNetworkRange setting (Cfg_Get, default 10), by gate jumps as Build_Networks in md/fdn_supply.xml
      (0 le gatedistance le range), nearest first, at most 3 names then '+N more'; 'Network: none in range' otherwise.
      Names only (no sector) to keep the row short. The DC tables now stop at $Max - 21 (129); worst case about 155 rows.
    - Card X4-16b (display only here): heading 'Recent activity (last X of N)', N = stored entries (up to 50, see
      Activity_Add). Still the 10 newest shown, so the row budget is unchanged. Skip entries (kind 'skip', 9 items) show
      row 1 'N min ago, skipped' (plus the skip kind when not supply) | 'need ware' and row 2 '    at station: reason',
      both in Color.text_warning. Older entries without a reason are drawn as before.
    - Card X4-16c (display only, plus one small view value): a control row under the Recent activity heading.
      Col 1 is one cycling button 'Show: <view>' (All, Supplies = supply and pull, Returns = return, NPC = NPC buy,
      Problems = skip). Col 2 'page X of Y'. Col 3 'Newer' and col 4 'Older' buttons, each only drawn when there is a
      page that way (otherwise an empty cell). 10 entries per page, 2 rows each, so the row budget is the heading,
      the control row and 20 rows: the DC tables now stop at $Max - 22 (128), worst case about 155 rows.
      View state: md.FDN_Core.Init.$OvView = table[$Filter (1 to 5), $Page], created when missing. The click handlers
      (and Refresh) set md.FDN_Core.Init.$OvKeep = true before Refresh_Menu; On_Open keeps the view only when that flag
      is set and then clears it, so opening the page fresh (or the game rebuilding it) starts at All, page 1.
      Same button pattern as Refresh (Make_Button with $col and $onClick in a row that also holds Make_Text cells).
  -->
  <cues>
    <cue name="Register" instantiate="true">
      <conditions>
        <event_cue_signalled cue="md.Simple_Menu_API.Reloaded" />
      </conditions>
      <actions>
        <signal_cue_instantly cue="md.Simple_Menu_API.Register_Options_Menu" param="table[
          $id = 'fdn_overview',
          $title = 'FDN Overview',
          $columns = 4,
          $onOpen = On_Open]" />
      </actions>
    </cue>

    <cue name="On_Open" instantiate="true">
      <conditions>
        <event_cue_signalled />
      </conditions>
      <actions>
        <set_value name="$Max" exact="150" comment="the API allows 160 rows; stop adding DC and ware rows here" />
        <set_value name="$Rows" exact="0" />
        <set_value name="$Shown" exact="0" />
        <set_value name="$Cut" exact="false" />

        <signal_cue_instantly cue="md.Simple_Menu_API.Add_Row" param="table[]" />
        <signal_cue_instantly cue="md.Simple_Menu_API.Make_Button" param="table[
          $col = 1,
          $text = table[$text = 'Refresh', $halign = 'center'],
          $mouseOverText = 'Reload the figures. The page does not update by itself',
          $onClick = On_Refresh]" />
        <signal_cue_instantly cue="md.Simple_Menu_API.Make_Text" param="table[$col = 2, $colSpan = 3, $text = 'Freight Distribution Network, read only. Totals since charter bought']" />
        <set_value name="$Rows" exact="$Rows + 1" />

        <set_value name="$DCs" exact="[]" />
        <set_value name="$Init" exact="md.FDN_Core.Init" />
        <do_if value="$Init.$Charters?">
          <set_value name="$Keys" exact="$Init.$Charters.keys.list" />
          <do_all exact="$Keys.count" counter="$k">
            <set_value name="$S" exact="$Keys.{$k}" />
            <do_if value="$S != null and $S.exists and $S.isplayerowned">
              <append_to_list name="$DCs" exact="$S" />
            </do_if>
          </do_all>
        </do_if>
        <sort_list list="$DCs" sortbyvalue="loop.element.knownname" comment="card X4-15c: DCs by name" />
        <run_actions ref="md.FDN_Core.Cfg_Get" result="$NetRange" comment="card X4-16a: same setting as Build_Networks">
          <param name="Key" value="'DCNetworkRange'" />
        </run_actions>

        <set_value name="$Sum" exact="table[$Supplies = 0, $Returns = 0, $Units = 0, $Fees = 0Cr]" comment="card X4-15c: totals over all DCs" />
        <do_if value="$Init.$DCStats?">
          <do_all exact="$DCs.count" counter="$d">
            <do_if value="$Init.$DCStats.{$DCs.{$d}}?">
              <set_value name="$T" exact="$Init.$DCStats.{$DCs.{$d}}" />
              <set_value name="$Sum.$Supplies" exact="$Sum.$Supplies + $T.$Supplies" />
              <set_value name="$Sum.$Returns" exact="$Sum.$Returns + $T.$Returns" />
              <set_value name="$Sum.$Units" exact="$Sum.$Units + $T.$Units" />
              <set_value name="$Sum.$Fees" exact="$Sum.$Fees + $T.$Fees" />
            </do_if>
          </do_all>
        </do_if>
        <signal_cue_instantly cue="md.Simple_Menu_API.Add_Row" param="table[$selectable = false]" />
        <signal_cue_instantly cue="md.Simple_Menu_API.Make_Text" param="table[$col = 1, $text = 'DCs online: %1'.[$DCs.count]]" />
        <signal_cue_instantly cue="md.Simple_Menu_API.Make_Text" param="table[$col = 2, $colSpan = 3, $text = 'Totals: %1 sent, %2 returned, %3 units, %4 fees'.[$Sum.$Supplies, $Sum.$Returns, $Sum.$Units, $Sum.$Fees.formatted.default + ' Cr']]" />
        <set_value name="$Rows" exact="$Rows + 1" />

        <signal_cue_instantly cue="md.Simple_Menu_API.Add_Row" param="table[$selectable = false]" comment="card X4-15e: Needs attention" />
        <signal_cue_instantly cue="md.Simple_Menu_API.Make_Text" param="table[$col = 1, $colSpan = 4, $font = 'Zekton bold', $text = 'Needs attention']" />
        <set_value name="$Rows" exact="$Rows + 1" />
        <set_value name="$Att" exact="[]" />
        <do_if value="$DCs.count gt 0 and $Init.$Attention?">
          <set_value name="$Keys" exact="$Init.$Attention.keys.list" />
          <do_all exact="$Keys.count" counter="$k">
            <set_value name="$S" exact="$Keys.{$k}" />
            <do_if value="$S != null and $S.exists and $S.isplayerowned">
              <append_to_list name="$Att" exact="$S" />
            </do_if>
          </do_all>
          <sort_list list="$Att" sortbyvalue="$Init.$Attention.{loop.element}.$Time" comment="oldest first, read back to front below" />
        </do_if>
        <do_if value="$DCs.count == 0">
          <signal_cue_instantly cue="md.Simple_Menu_API.Add_Row" param="table[$selectable = false]" />
          <signal_cue_instantly cue="md.Simple_Menu_API.Make_Text" param="table[$col = 1, $colSpan = 4, $text = 'No DC exists, so the FDN supplies nothing and stations trade as normal']" />
          <set_value name="$Rows" exact="$Rows + 1" />
        </do_if>
        <do_elseif value="$Att.count == 0">
          <signal_cue_instantly cue="md.Simple_Menu_API.Add_Row" param="table[$selectable = false]" />
          <signal_cue_instantly cue="md.Simple_Menu_API.Make_Text" param="table[$col = 1, $colSpan = 4, $text = 'Nothing needs attention']" />
          <set_value name="$Rows" exact="$Rows + 1" />
        </do_elseif>
        <do_else>
          <signal_cue_instantly cue="md.Simple_Menu_API.Add_Row" param="table[$selectable = false]" />
          <signal_cue_instantly cue="md.Simple_Menu_API.Make_Text" param="table[$col = 1, $text = 'Station']" />
          <signal_cue_instantly cue="md.Simple_Menu_API.Make_Text" param="table[$col = 2, $text = 'Ware']" />
          <signal_cue_instantly cue="md.Simple_Menu_API.Make_Text" param="table[$col = 3, $colSpan = 2, $text = 'Reason, last seen']" />
          <set_value name="$Rows" exact="$Rows + 1" />
          <set_value name="$AttShown" exact="0" />
          <do_all exact="$Att.count" counter="$a" reverse="true">
            <do_if value="$AttShown ge 15">
              <break />
            </do_if>
            <set_value name="$S" exact="$Att.{$a}" />
            <set_value name="$E" exact="$Init.$Attention.{$S}" />
            <set_value name="$Mins" exact="((player.age - $E.$Time) / 60s)i" />
            <signal_cue_instantly cue="md.Simple_Menu_API.Add_Row" param="table[$selectable = false]" />
            <signal_cue_instantly cue="md.Simple_Menu_API.Make_Text" param="table[$col = 1, $text = $S.knownname, $color = 'Color.text_warning']" />
            <signal_cue_instantly cue="md.Simple_Menu_API.Make_Text" param="table[$col = 2, $text = $E.$Ware.name]" />
            <signal_cue_instantly cue="md.Simple_Menu_API.Make_Text" param="table[$col = 3, $colSpan = 2, $text = '%1, %2 min ago'.[$E.$Reason, $Mins]]" />
            <set_value name="$Rows" exact="$Rows + 1" />
            <set_value name="$AttShown" exact="$AttShown + 1" />
          </do_all>
          <do_if value="$Att.count gt $AttShown">
            <signal_cue_instantly cue="md.Simple_Menu_API.Add_Row" param="table[$selectable = false]" />
            <signal_cue_instantly cue="md.Simple_Menu_API.Make_Text" param="table[$col = 1, $colSpan = 4, $text = '%1 more not shown'.[$Att.count - $AttShown]]" />
            <set_value name="$Rows" exact="$Rows + 1" />
          </do_if>
        </do_else>

        <do_if value="$DCs.count == 0">
          <signal_cue_instantly cue="md.Simple_Menu_API.Add_Row" param="table[$selectable = false]" />
          <signal_cue_instantly cue="md.Simple_Menu_API.Make_Text" param="table[$col = 1, $colSpan = 4, $text = 'No Freight Distribution Centres. Buy an FDN charter from a station right-click menu to make one']" />
          <set_value name="$Rows" exact="$Rows + 1" />
        </do_if>

        <do_all exact="$DCs.count" counter="$d">
          <do_if value="$Rows ge $Max - 22" comment="card X4-15f/16a/16c: room for Recent activity (heading, control row, 2 rows per entry) and the Network row">
            <set_value name="$Cut" exact="true" />
            <break />
          </do_if>
          <set_value name="$S" exact="$DCs.{$d}" />
          <set_value name="$State" exact="''" />
          <do_if value="$Init.$Charters.{$S}.$DockMiss?">
            <set_value name="$State" exact="' (no working dock, the charter ends soon if none returns)'" />
          </do_if>
          <set_value name="$Where" exact="', ' + $S.sector.knownname" />
          <substitute_text text="$Probe" source="$S.knownname" comment="card X4-15b: removes the sector name from the station name; if anything changed, the name already contains the sector">
            <replace string="$S.sector.knownname" with="''" />
          </substitute_text>
          <do_if value="$Probe != $S.knownname">
            <set_value name="$Where" exact="''" />
          </do_if>
          <signal_cue_instantly cue="md.Simple_Menu_API.Add_Row" param="table[$selectable = false]" />
          <signal_cue_instantly cue="md.Simple_Menu_API.Make_Text" param="table[$col = 1, $colSpan = 4, $font = 'Zekton bold', $text = '%1%2%3'.[$S.knownname, $Where, $State]]" />
          <set_value name="$Near" exact="table[]" comment="card X4-16a: other DC -> gate jumps, within DCNetworkRange" />
          <do_all exact="$DCs.count" counter="$o">
            <set_value name="$O" exact="$DCs.{$o}" />
            <do_if value="$O != $S">
              <set_value name="$J" exact="$S.gatedistance.{$O}" />
              <do_if value="$J ge 0 and $J le $NetRange">
                <set_value name="$Near.{$O}" exact="$J" />
              </do_if>
            </do_if>
          </do_all>
          <set_value name="$NearList" exact="$Near.keys.sorted" comment="sorted by value (jumps), nearest first (keys.sorted, as used in md/fdn_supply.xml)" />
          <set_value name="$NetText" exact="'Network: none in range'" />
          <do_if value="$NearList.count gt 0">
            <set_value name="$NetText" exact="'Network: '" />
            <do_all exact="[$NearList.count, 3].min" counter="$n">
              <do_if value="$n gt 1">
                <set_value name="$NetText" exact="$NetText + ', '" />
              </do_if>
              <set_value name="$NetText" exact="$NetText + '%1 (%2 %3)'.[$NearList.{$n}.knownname, $Near.{$NearList.{$n}}, (if $Near.{$NearList.{$n}} == 1 then 'jump' else 'jumps')]" />
            </do_all>
            <do_if value="$NearList.count gt 3">
              <set_value name="$NetText" exact="$NetText + ', +%1 more'.[$NearList.count - 3]" />
            </do_if>
          </do_if>
          <signal_cue_instantly cue="md.Simple_Menu_API.Add_Row" param="table[$selectable = false]" />
          <signal_cue_instantly cue="md.Simple_Menu_API.Make_Text" param="table[$col = 1, $colSpan = 4, $text = $NetText]" />
          <set_value name="$Rows" exact="$Rows + 1" />
          <signal_cue_instantly cue="md.Simple_Menu_API.Add_Row" param="table[$selectable = false]" />
          <signal_cue_instantly cue="md.Simple_Menu_API.Make_Text" param="table[$col = 1, $text = 'Ware']" />
          <signal_cue_instantly cue="md.Simple_Menu_API.Make_Text" param="table[$col = 2, $text = 'Stock', $halign = 'right']" />
          <signal_cue_instantly cue="md.Simple_Menu_API.Make_Text" param="table[$col = 3, $text = 'Target', $halign = 'right']" />
          <signal_cue_instantly cue="md.Simple_Menu_API.Make_Text" param="table[$col = 4, $text = '% of target', $halign = 'right']" />
          <set_value name="$Rows" exact="$Rows + 2" />
          <set_value name="$Shown" exact="$Shown + 1" />

          <set_value name="$Wares" exact="$S.cargo.list" comment="wares with a non-zero amount" />
          <set_value name="$PctOf" exact="table[]" comment="card X4-15c: ware -> whole percent of target, 1000000 when there is no target (sorts last)" />
          <do_all exact="$Wares.count" counter="$w">
            <set_value name="$PctOf.{$Wares.{$w}}" exact="1000000" />
            <do_if value="$S.cargo.{$Wares.{$w}}.target?">
              <do_if value="$S.cargo.{$Wares.{$w}}.target gt 0">
                <set_value name="$PctOf.{$Wares.{$w}}" exact="(($S.cargo.{$Wares.{$w}}.count * 100) / $S.cargo.{$Wares.{$w}}.target)i" />
              </do_if>
            </do_if>
          </do_all>
          <sort_list list="$Wares" sortbyvalue="$PctOf.{loop.element}" comment="card X4-15c: emptiest first" />
          <do_if value="$Wares.count == 0">
            <signal_cue_instantly cue="md.Simple_Menu_API.Add_Row" param="table[$selectable = false]" />
            <signal_cue_instantly cue="md.Simple_Menu_API.Make_Text" param="table[$col = 1, $colSpan = 4, $text = 'No wares in stock']" />
            <set_value name="$Rows" exact="$Rows + 1" />
          </do_if>
          <do_all exact="$Wares.count" counter="$w">
            <do_if value="$Rows ge $Max - 22" comment="card X4-15f/16a/16c: room for Recent activity (heading, control row, 2 rows per entry) and the Network row">
              <set_value name="$Cut" exact="true" />
              <break />
            </do_if>
            <set_value name="$W" exact="$Wares.{$w}" />
            <set_value name="$Target" exact="0" />
            <do_if value="$S.cargo.{$W}.target?">
              <set_value name="$Target" exact="$S.cargo.{$W}.target" />
            </do_if>
            <signal_cue_instantly cue="md.Simple_Menu_API.Add_Row" param="table[$selectable = false]" />
            <signal_cue_instantly cue="md.Simple_Menu_API.Make_Text" param="table[$col = 1, $text = $W.name]" />
            <set_value name="$Pct" exact="$PctOf.{$W}" />
            <do_if value="$Pct lt 25">
              <signal_cue_instantly cue="md.Simple_Menu_API.Make_Text" param="table[$col = 2, $text = '%1'.[$S.cargo.{$W}.count], $halign = 'right', $color = 'Color.text_negative']" />
            </do_if>
            <do_elseif value="$Pct le 75">
              <signal_cue_instantly cue="md.Simple_Menu_API.Make_Text" param="table[$col = 2, $text = '%1'.[$S.cargo.{$W}.count], $halign = 'right', $color = 'Color.text_warning']" />
            </do_elseif>
            <do_else>
              <signal_cue_instantly cue="md.Simple_Menu_API.Make_Text" param="table[$col = 2, $text = '%1'.[$S.cargo.{$W}.count], $halign = 'right']" />
            </do_else>
            <signal_cue_instantly cue="md.Simple_Menu_API.Make_Text" param="table[$col = 3, $text = '%1'.[$Target], $halign = 'right']" />
            <set_value name="$PctText" exact="'-'" />
            <do_if value="$Pct lt 1000000">
              <set_value name="$PctText" exact="'%1'.[$Pct] + ' %'" comment="the percent sign is added after formatting, never inside the format string" />
            </do_if>
            <signal_cue_instantly cue="md.Simple_Menu_API.Make_Text" param="table[$col = 4, $text = $PctText, $halign = 'right']" />
            <set_value name="$Rows" exact="$Rows + 1" />
          </do_all>

          <set_value name="$St" exact="table[$Supplies = 0, $Returns = 0, $Units = 0, $Fees = 0Cr]" />
          <do_if value="$Init.$DCStats?">
            <do_if value="$Init.$DCStats.{$S}?">
              <set_value name="$St" exact="$Init.$DCStats.{$S}" />
            </do_if>
          </do_if>
          <signal_cue_instantly cue="md.Simple_Menu_API.Add_Row" param="table[$selectable = false]" />
          <signal_cue_instantly cue="md.Simple_Menu_API.Make_Text" param="table[$col = 1, $colSpan = 4, $text = 'Totals: %1 supplies sent, %2 returns received, %3 units moved, fees paid %4'.[$St.$Supplies, $St.$Returns, $St.$Units, $St.$Fees.formatted.default + ' Cr']]" />
          <set_value name="$Rows" exact="$Rows + 1" />
          <do_if value="$Cut">
            <break />
          </do_if>
        </do_all>

        <do_if value="$Cut">
          <signal_cue_instantly cue="md.Simple_Menu_API.Add_Row" param="table[$selectable = false]" />
          <signal_cue_instantly cue="md.Simple_Menu_API.Make_Text" param="table[$col = 1, $colSpan = 4, $text = 'More not shown: the page holds at most 160 rows. %1 of %2 DCs listed, the last one may be incomplete'.[$Shown, $DCs.count]]" />
          <set_value name="$Rows" exact="$Rows + 1" />
        </do_if>

        <set_value name="$Act" exact="[]" />
        <do_if value="$Init.$Activity?">
          <set_value name="$Act" exact="$Init.$Activity" />
        </do_if>
        <set_value name="$Keep" exact="false" comment="card X4-16c: view state, see header" />
        <do_if value="$Init.$OvKeep?">
          <set_value name="$Keep" exact="$Init.$OvKeep" />
        </do_if>
        <set_value name="$Init.$OvKeep" exact="false" />
        <do_if value="not $Keep or not $Init.$OvView?">
          <set_value name="$Init.$OvView" exact="table[$Filter = 1, $Page = 1]" />
        </do_if>
        <set_value name="$View" exact="$Init.$OvView" />
        <set_value name="$ViewNames" exact="['All', 'Supplies', 'Returns', 'NPC', 'Problems']" />
        <do_if value="$View.$Filter lt 1 or $View.$Filter gt 5">
          <set_value name="$View.$Filter" exact="1" />
        </do_if>
        <set_value name="$F" exact="[]" />
        <do_all exact="$Act.count" counter="$a">
          <set_value name="$K" exact="$Act.{$a}.{2}" />
          <do_if value="$View.$Filter == 1 or ($View.$Filter == 2 and ($K == 'supply' or $K == 'pull')) or ($View.$Filter == 3 and $K == 'return') or ($View.$Filter == 4 and $K == 'NPC buy') or ($View.$Filter == 5 and $K == 'skip')">
            <append_to_list name="$F" exact="$Act.{$a}" />
          </do_if>
        </do_all>
        <set_value name="$Pages" exact="[(($F.count + 9) / 10)i, 1].max" />
        <set_value name="$View.$Page" exact="[[$View.$Page, 1].max, $Pages].min" />
        <set_value name="$First" exact="($View.$Page - 1) * 10 + 1" />
        <set_value name="$Last" exact="[$View.$Page * 10, $F.count].min" />
        <signal_cue_instantly cue="md.Simple_Menu_API.Add_Row" param="table[$selectable = false]" comment="card X4-15e: Recent activity" />
        <do_if value="$F.count == 0">
          <signal_cue_instantly cue="md.Simple_Menu_API.Make_Text" param="table[$col = 1, $colSpan = 4, $font = 'Zekton bold', $text = 'Recent activity (%1, none of %2 stored)'.[$ViewNames.{$View.$Filter}, $Act.count]]" comment="card X4-16c" />
        </do_if>
        <do_else>
          <signal_cue_instantly cue="md.Simple_Menu_API.Make_Text" param="table[$col = 1, $colSpan = 4, $font = 'Zekton bold', $text = 'Recent activity (%1, page %2 of %3, entries %4-%5 of %6)'.[$ViewNames.{$View.$Filter}, $View.$Page, $Pages, $First, $Last, $F.count]]" comment="card X4-16c" />
        </do_else>
        <set_value name="$Rows" exact="$Rows + 1" />
        <signal_cue_instantly cue="md.Simple_Menu_API.Add_Row" param="table[]" comment="card X4-16c: control row" />
        <signal_cue_instantly cue="md.Simple_Menu_API.Make_Button" param="table[
          $col = 1,
          $text = table[$text = 'Show: ' + $ViewNames.{$View.$Filter}, $halign = 'center'],
          $mouseOverText = 'Change what Recent activity shows: All, Supplies, Returns, NPC, Problems',
          $onClick = On_Filter]" />
        <signal_cue_instantly cue="md.Simple_Menu_API.Make_Text" param="table[$col = 2, $text = 'page %1 of %2'.[$View.$Page, $Pages], $halign = 'center']" />
        <do_if value="$View.$Page gt 1">
          <signal_cue_instantly cue="md.Simple_Menu_API.Make_Button" param="table[
            $col = 3,
            $text = table[$text = 'Newer', $halign = 'center'],
            $mouseOverText = 'Show the previous (newer) 10 entries',
            $onClick = On_Newer]" />
        </do_if>
        <do_if value="$View.$Page lt $Pages">
          <signal_cue_instantly cue="md.Simple_Menu_API.Make_Button" param="table[
            $col = 4,
            $text = table[$text = 'Older', $halign = 'center'],
            $mouseOverText = 'Show the next (older) 10 entries',
            $onClick = On_Older]" />
        </do_if>
        <set_value name="$Rows" exact="$Rows + 1" />
        <do_if value="$F.count == 0">
          <signal_cue_instantly cue="md.Simple_Menu_API.Add_Row" param="table[$selectable = false]" />
          <do_if value="$Act.count == 0">
            <signal_cue_instantly cue="md.Simple_Menu_API.Make_Text" param="table[$col = 1, $colSpan = 4, $text = 'No supplies or returns recorded yet']" />
          </do_if>
          <do_else>
            <signal_cue_instantly cue="md.Simple_Menu_API.Make_Text" param="table[$col = 1, $colSpan = 4, $text = 'No ' + $ViewNames.{$View.$Filter} + ' entries']" />
          </do_else>
          <set_value name="$Rows" exact="$Rows + 1" />
        </do_if>
        <do_all exact="[$Last - $First + 1, 0].max" counter="$a">
          <set_value name="$E" exact="$F.{$First + $a - 1}" />
          <set_value name="$Mins" exact="((player.age - $E.{1}) / 60s)i" />
          <do_if value="$E.{2} == 'skip' and $E.count ge 9" comment="card X4-16b: skip entry, warning colour">
            <set_value name="$SkipTxt" exact="if $E.{9} == 'supply' or $E.{9} == '' then 'skipped' else 'skipped ' + $E.{9}" />
            <signal_cue_instantly cue="md.Simple_Menu_API.Add_Row" param="table[$selectable = false]" />
            <signal_cue_instantly cue="md.Simple_Menu_API.Make_Text" param="table[$col = 1, $text = '%1 min ago, %2'.[$Mins, $SkipTxt], $color = 'Color.text_warning']" />
            <signal_cue_instantly cue="md.Simple_Menu_API.Make_Text" param="table[$col = 2, $colSpan = 2, $text = '%1 %2'.[$E.{4}, $E.{3}.name], $color = 'Color.text_warning']" />
            <signal_cue_instantly cue="md.Simple_Menu_API.Add_Row" param="table[$selectable = false]" />
            <signal_cue_instantly cue="md.Simple_Menu_API.Make_Text" param="table[$col = 1, $colSpan = 4, $text = '    at %1: %2'.[$E.{6}, $E.{8}], $color = 'Color.text_warning']" />
          </do_if>
          <do_else>
            <signal_cue_instantly cue="md.Simple_Menu_API.Add_Row" param="table[$selectable = false]" />
            <signal_cue_instantly cue="md.Simple_Menu_API.Make_Text" param="table[$col = 1, $text = '%1 min ago, %2'.[$Mins, $E.{2}]]" />
            <signal_cue_instantly cue="md.Simple_Menu_API.Make_Text" param="table[$col = 2, $colSpan = 2, $text = '%1 %2'.[$E.{4}, $E.{3}.name]]" />
            <signal_cue_instantly cue="md.Simple_Menu_API.Make_Text" param="table[$col = 4, $text = 'fee ' + $E.{7}.formatted.default + ' Cr', $halign = 'right']" />
            <signal_cue_instantly cue="md.Simple_Menu_API.Add_Row" param="table[$selectable = false]" comment="card X4-15f: route on its own full-width row" />
            <signal_cue_instantly cue="md.Simple_Menu_API.Make_Text" param="table[$col = 1, $colSpan = 4, $text = '    from %1 to %2'.[$E.{5}, $E.{6}]]" />
          </do_else>
          <set_value name="$Rows" exact="$Rows + 2" />
        </do_all>

        <run_actions ref="md.FDN_Core.Log">
          <param name="Level" value="4" />
          <param name="Text" value="'overview page opened: %1 DCs, %2 listed, %3 rows%4, %5 attention, %6 activity'.[$DCs.count, $Shown, $Rows, (if $Cut then ', more not shown' else ''), $Att.count, $Act.count] + ', view %1 page %2 of %3, %4 match'.[$ViewNames.{$View.$Filter}, $View.$Page, $Pages, $F.count]" />
        </run_actions>
      </actions>
    </cue>

    <cue name="On_Refresh" instantiate="true">
      <conditions>
        <event_cue_signalled />
      </conditions>
      <actions>
        <set_value name="md.FDN_Core.Init.$OvKeep" exact="true" comment="card X4-16c: Refresh keeps the current view" />
        <signal_cue_instantly cue="md.Simple_Menu_API.Refresh_Menu" param="table[]" />
      </actions>
    </cue>

    <cue name="On_Filter" instantiate="true" comment="card X4-16c: next view (All, Supplies, Returns, NPC, Problems), back to page 1">
      <conditions>
        <event_cue_signalled />
      </conditions>
      <actions>
        <set_value name="$Init" exact="md.FDN_Core.Init" />
        <do_if value="not $Init.$OvView?">
          <set_value name="$Init.$OvView" exact="table[$Filter = 1, $Page = 1]" />
        </do_if>
        <set_value name="$Init.$OvView.$Filter" exact="if $Init.$OvView.$Filter ge 5 then 1 else $Init.$OvView.$Filter + 1" />
        <set_value name="$Init.$OvView.$Page" exact="1" />
        <set_value name="$Init.$OvKeep" exact="true" />
        <signal_cue_instantly cue="md.Simple_Menu_API.Refresh_Menu" param="table[]" />
      </actions>
    </cue>

    <cue name="On_Newer" instantiate="true" comment="card X4-16c: one page newer (On_Open clamps the page)">
      <conditions>
        <event_cue_signalled />
      </conditions>
      <actions>
        <set_value name="$Init" exact="md.FDN_Core.Init" />
        <do_if value="$Init.$OvView?">
          <set_value name="$Init.$OvView.$Page" exact="$Init.$OvView.$Page - 1" />
        </do_if>
        <set_value name="$Init.$OvKeep" exact="true" />
        <signal_cue_instantly cue="md.Simple_Menu_API.Refresh_Menu" param="table[]" />
      </actions>
    </cue>

    <cue name="On_Older" instantiate="true" comment="card X4-16c: one page older (On_Open clamps the page)">
      <conditions>
        <event_cue_signalled />
      </conditions>
      <actions>
        <set_value name="$Init" exact="md.FDN_Core.Init" />
        <do_if value="$Init.$OvView?">
          <set_value name="$Init.$OvView.$Page" exact="$Init.$OvView.$Page + 1" />
        </do_if>
        <set_value name="$Init.$OvKeep" exact="true" />
        <signal_cue_instantly cue="md.Simple_Menu_API.Refresh_Menu" param="table[]" />
      </actions>
    </cue>
  </cues>
</mdscript>